* ==========================================================
* BFR181W NPN Silicon RF Transistor SPICE Model
* Source: Infineon Datasheet (Oct-13-1999)
* Package: SOT-323
* ==========================================================
* Pin Mapping:
* 1 = Base
* 2 = Emitter
* 3 = Collector
* ==========================================================

.SUBCKT BFR181W 1 2 3

* ----------------------------------------------------------
* Package Parasitics (SOT-323 Equivalent Circuit)
* ----------------------------------------------------------
* Base Inductances
LBO 1 B_pkg 0.4nH
LBI B_pkg B_chip 0.57nH

* Emitter Inductances
LEO 2 E_pkg 0.5nH
LEI E_pkg E_chip 0.43nH

* Collector Inductances
* Datasheet specifies LCI = 0nH. LCO is unlisted (-).
* A nominal 1pH (0.001nH) is used to prevent ngspice singularity errors.
LCO 3 C_pkg 0.001nH
LCI C_pkg C_chip 0.001nH

* Package Inter-pin Capacitances
CCB B_pkg C_pkg 101fF
CBE B_pkg E_pkg 61fF
CCE C_pkg E_pkg 175fF

* ----------------------------------------------------------
* Core Transistor Chip Model
* ----------------------------------------------------------
* SPICE Q instance format: Collector Base Emitter
Q1 C_chip B_chip E_chip BFR181W_CHIP

* Gummel-Poon Parameters from Datasheet Page 4
* Units converted to standard SPICE scientific notation (e.g. fA -> E-15)
.MODEL BFR181W_CHIP NPN(
+ IS=1.0519E-18 BF=96.461 NF=0.90617 VAF=22.403 IKF=0.12146
+ ISE=12.603E-15 NE=1.7631 BR=16.504 NR=0.87757 VAR=5.1127
+ IKR=0.24951 ISC=11.95E-18 NC=1.6528 RB=9.9037 IRB=0.69278E-3
+ RBM=6.6315 RE=2.1372 RC=2.2171 CJE=1.8168E-15 VJE=0.73155
+ MJE=0.43619 TF=17.028E-12 XTF=0.33814 VTF=0.12571 ITF=1.0549E-3
+ PTF=0 CJC=319.69E-15 VJC=1.1633 MJC=0.30013 XCJC=0.082903
+ TR=2.7449E-9 CJS=0 VJS=0.75 MJS=0 XTB=0 EG=1.11 XTI=3 FC=0.99768
+ TNOM=26.85)

.ENDS BFR181W